1. Download the both files "here" and "flag" using "wget".
2. Run python level2.py and it prompts to enter password.
3. Open level2.py file content and copy the "chr(0x34) + chr(0x65) + chr(0x63) + chr(0x39)" and findout the value for those using python interpreter and press ctrl+z to exit.
4. Again run the level2.py file and enter the password.
5. The flag will appear.


